{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================
  hideAWAY Welcome Popup V2 — Shopify section
  ============================================================

  Custom Klaviyo-integrated popup that subscribes visitors to:
    • hideAWAY Welcome 2026 — Email   (list id: UiypqE)
    • hideAWAY Welcome 2026 — SMS     (list id: V7rcLr)

  3-step flow, no OTP verification: Email → SMS (optional) → Success
  with an instant on-screen discount code (static code, no click-out).

  Note: this section uses Klaviyo's public Client API so no server-side
  secret is needed. The company_id is public-safe. The discount code is
  a real, static, uncapped code (WELCOME12) — no backend call required
  to reveal it.

  Mobile hardening (Jul 2026):
    • Scroll lock now uses the position:fixed body technique — iOS Safari
      and in-app browsers (Instagram/Facebook) ignore body overflow:hidden,
      which let the page keep scrolling behind the overlay while the overlay
      swallowed every tap (reported as "page endlessly scrolls, can't add
      to cart" on product pages).
    • Scroll-percent trigger is disabled on /products/ pages — reading a
      product description on a phone is 30% scroll, so the popup was
      interrupting every PDP read. Timer trigger still applies.
    • Dismissal is remembered in BOTH localStorage and a cookie — in-app
      browsers frequently drop localStorage, which made the popup reappear
      on every page view.
    • Inputs are only auto-focused on desktop so the mobile keyboard does
      not pop over the sheet.

  Toggle "Enabled" off in Theme Customizer to disable without removing code.
  ============================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign current_path = request.path | downcase
  assign exclude_csv = s.exclude_paths | default: '/cart,/checkout,/account'
  comment
    Bundle builder pages (/apps/gbb) are always excluded — bundle pricing is
    already marked down, so no welcome-code stacking (margin protection).
  endcomment
  assign exclude_csv = exclude_csv | append: ',/apps/gbb'
  assign exclude_paths = exclude_csv | split: ','
-%}

{%- if s.enabled -%}

  {%- comment -%} Suppress on excluded paths server-side too (one less render) {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign suppress = false -%}
  {%- for path in exclude_paths -%}
    {%- assign p = path | strip | downcase -%}
    {%- if p != blank and current_path contains p -%}
      {%- assign suppress = true -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}

  {%- unless suppress -%}

    <style>
      .hwp-overlay {
        position: fixed; inset: 0;
        background: rgba(20, 20, 20, 0.55);
        display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        z-index: 999998;
        opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.25s ease;
        padding: 16px;
        overscroll-behavior: contain;
      }
      .hwp-overlay.hwp-visible { display: flex; opacity: 1; }

      .hwp-popup {
        position: relative;
        width: 480px; max-width: 100%;
        max-height: 100%;
        overflow-y: auto;
        -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
        overscroll-behavior: contain;
        background: {{ s.bg_color | default: '#EEE7E6' }};
        color: {{ s.text_color | default: '#303030' }};
        border-radius: {{ s.card_radius | default: 16 }}px;
        box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
        font-family: var(--font-primary, 'MADETommySoft', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif);
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        animation: hwp-pop 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
      }
      @keyframes hwp-pop {
        from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.94) translateY(16px); }
        to   { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1) translateY(0); }
      }

      .hwp-close {
        position: absolute; top: 14px; right: 14px;
        width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%;
        background: rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border: 0;
        color: {{ s.text_color | default: '#303030' }}; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1;
        cursor: pointer;
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        transition: background 0.15s; z-index: 5;
      }
      .hwp-close:hover { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.15); }

      .hwp-band {
        background: {{ s.band_color | default: '#FFED99' }};
        padding: 20px 0;
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      }
      .hwp-wordmark {
        font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px;
        color: {{ s.text_color | default: '#303030' }};
        letter-spacing: 0.2px;
      }
      .hwp-wordmark img { height: 22px; display: block; }

      .hwp-body { padding: 40px 40px 36px; text-align: left; }
      .hwp-headline {
        font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2;
        margin: 0 0 10px; color: {{ s.text_color | default: '#303030' }};
      }
      .hwp-sub {
        font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 400;
        color: {{ s.body_text_color | default: '#666666' }};
        margin: 0 0 20px;
      }

      .hwp-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }

      .hwp-input {
        width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 14px 16px;
        border: 1px solid {{ s.input_border_color | default: '#E5E5E5' }};
        background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 8px;
        font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px;
        color: {{ s.text_color | default: '#303030' }}; outline: none;
        transition: box-shadow 0.15s;
        -webkit-appearance: none;
      }
      .hwp-input:focus { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px {{ s.accent_color | default: '#FC76C4' }}55; }
      .hwp-input::placeholder { color: #999999; }

      .hwp-input-phone {
        display: flex; align-items: stretch; padding: 0; overflow: hidden;
        background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid {{ s.input_border_color | default: '#E5E5E5' }};
        border-radius: 8px;
      }
      .hwp-input-phone .hwp-country {
        padding: 14px 10px 14px 16px;
        color: {{ s.text_color | default: '#303030' }}; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500;
        display: flex; align-items: center;
        user-select: none; white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .hwp-input-phone input {
        flex: 1; min-width: 0; border: 0; padding: 14px 16px 14px 0;
        font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; color: {{ s.text_color | default: '#303030' }}; outline: none;
        background: transparent; -webkit-appearance: none;
      }

      .hwp-error {
        color: #C0392B; font-size: 12px;
        margin: -8px 2px 0; min-height: 1em; text-align: left;
      }

      .hwp-btn {
        display: block; box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; text-decoration: none;
        width: 100%; padding: 14px 16px;
        border: 0; border-radius: 8px;
        font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: 700;
        cursor: pointer;
        background: {{ s.accent_color | default: '#FC76C4' }}; color: #FFFFFF;
        transition: background 0.15s;
      }
      .hwp-btn:hover:not(:disabled) { background: {{ s.accent_hover_color | default: '#E15BA9' }}; }
      .hwp-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.6; cursor: not-allowed; }

      .hwp-btn-secondary {
        background: transparent; color: #999999;
        text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px;
        font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; font-family: inherit;
        padding: 4px; margin: 0; text-align: center; cursor: pointer; border: 0;
      }
      .hwp-btn-secondary:hover:not(:disabled) { color: {{ s.text_color | default: '#303030' }}; }

      .hwp-fineprint {
        font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5;
        color: #999999; margin-top: 4px;
      }
      .hwp-fineprint a { color: #999999; }

      .hwp-coupon {
        width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center;
        padding: 18px 16px; margin-bottom: 20px;
        border: 2px dashed {{ s.accent_color | default: '#FC76C4' }};
        border-radius: 8px; background: #FFFFFF;
        display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;
        cursor: pointer; position: relative;
      }
      .hwp-coupon-label {
        font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px;
        color: #999999; text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .hwp-coupon-code {
        font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px;
        color: {{ s.accent_hover_color | default: '#E15BA9' }};
      }
      .hwp-coupon-copied {
        position: absolute; top: -10px; right: 12px;
        background: {{ s.text_color | default: '#303030' }}; color: #FFFFFF;
        font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 999px;
        opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.2s;
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      .hwp-coupon-copied.hwp-show { opacity: 1; }

      .hwp-step { display: none; }
      .hwp-step.hwp-active { display: block; }

      .hwp-teaser {
        position: fixed; bottom: 24px; left: 24px;
        background: {{ s.band_color | default: '#FFED99' }}; color: {{ s.text_color | default: '#303030' }};
        padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
        display: none; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
        z-index: 999997; border: 0; font-family: inherit;
        animation: hwp-pop 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
      }
      .hwp-teaser.hwp-visible { display: flex; }
      .hwp-teaser-dot {
        width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%;
        background: {{ s.accent_color | default: '#FC76C4' }};
        animation: hwp-pulse 2s infinite;
      }
      @keyframes hwp-pulse {
        0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
        50%      { transform: scale(1.3); opacity: 0.6; }
      }

      @media (max-width: 540px) {
        .hwp-overlay { padding: 0; align-items: flex-end; }
        .hwp-popup {
          width: 100%; max-width: 100%;
          border-radius: 20px 20px 0 0;
          animation: hwp-slide-up 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
        }
        .hwp-body { padding: 28px 24px 28px; }
        .hwp-headline { font-size: 24px; }
        .hwp-handle {
          width: 40px; height: 4px; border-radius: 2px;
          background: rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
          position: absolute; top: 10px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
          z-index: 6;
        }
      }
      @media (min-width: 541px) { .hwp-handle { display: none; } }
      @keyframes hwp-slide-up {
        from { transform: translateY(100%); }
        to   { transform: translateY(0); }
      }
    </style>

    <div class="hwp-overlay" id="hwp-overlay" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="hwp-headline" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="hwp-popup" role="document">
        <div class="hwp-handle"></div>
        <button class="hwp-close" id="hwp-close" aria-label="Close">×</button>

        <div class="hwp-step hwp-active" data-step="1">
          <div class="hwp-band">
            {%- if s.logo_image != blank -%}
              <span class="hwp-wordmark"><img src="{{ s.logo_image | image_url: width: 200 }}" alt="hideaway."></span>
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="hwp-wordmark">hideaway.</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
          <div class="hwp-body">
            <h2 class="hwp-headline" id="hwp-headline">{{ s.email_headline | default: "Get 12% off your first order." }}</h2>
            <p class="hwp-sub">{{ s.email_sub | default: "Pop in your email and we'll send your code straight away. No spam, just scents." }}</p>
            <form class="hwp-form" id="hwp-email-form" novalidate>
